// of a pointer PARAMETER's pointee written through, on the summary road: a callee's store at a composed path is re-resolved at each pointer-typed hop
// (`escape_hop_mut`), and alias judges the written path through the hop's targets (`check_hop_written`, with a seen set keyed by the target's root,
